WellMetin bundles these third-party components:

SQLite JDBC 3.46.1.3 (Xerial), under the Apache License 2.0, including
the David Crawshaw/Zentus portions under their BSD license.
Gson 2.11.0 (Google), under the Apache License 2.0. Its package names
are relocated to com.wellsetups.wellmetin.internal.gson.

Error Prone annotations are used only at compile time and are not bundled.

The complete Apache License 2.0 is included in
META-INF/maven/org.xerial/sqlite-jdbc/LICENSE.
The Zentus copyright notice and license are included in
META-INF/maven/org.xerial/sqlite-jdbc/LICENSE.zentus.

The server API is supplied by the Minecraft server and is not bundled.
